					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-8444558#post-4050868</guid>
				<title>Re: Hurray!</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-8444558/alexylva-university-hub#post-4050868</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Mon, 05 Nov 2018 23:35:51 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Ihp</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1267048</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>So all I really did was write out a massive dump of what my headcanon was for the Alexylva universe based on what I got from the various SCPs, as well as what I could dig up on the Punic Wars and Carthage. A lot of the &quot;Writing Guide&quot; stuff was on my sandbox for about a year before I got rid of it, but I moved it to a Google doc because I thought it would be a good resource.</p> <p>So, here we are. Hope the University gets more traction now.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
