					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I gotta say, this doesn´t make much sense. If carthage won why is everything so roman?</p> <p>When Rome conquered Carthage in our world, it destroyed Carthage utterly, little was left behind, so it wouldn´t be surprising if Carthage did the same. SPECIALLY during the 2nd punic war, considering thant Hannibal absolutely hated crazy Rome guts, he would´ve done the same to Rome and probably worse.</p> <p>It doesnt really make much sense tbh</p> 
				 	]]>
