						 <p>Well, this is done. A collaboration with <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ihp" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1267048&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1569714963" alt="Ihp" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1267048)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ihp" >Ihp</a></span>, who provided a lot of background info and some images, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3487700&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1569714963" alt="Uncle Nicolini" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3487700)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini" >Uncle Nicolini</a></span>, who created the amazing CSS. Thanks to you both, not to mention our various critters, including but not limited to: <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zyn" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1404533&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1569714963" alt="Zyn" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1404533)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zyn" >Zyn</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/eskobar" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1173523&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1569714963" alt="Eskobar" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1173523)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/eskobar" >Eskobar</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/meserach" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1507289&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1569714963" alt="Meserach" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1507289)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/meserach" >Meserach</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/alces" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3603766&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1569714963" alt="Alces" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3603766)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/alces" >Alces</a></span>, as well as <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sunnyclockwork" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1621343&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1569714963" alt="SunnyClockwork" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1621343)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sunnyclockwork" >SunnyClockwork</a></span> for letting us use the logo for MTF Rho-1. I really hope this inspires more people to write for this underused Group of Interest!</p> <p>~ Images ~<br /> columns: <a href="http://www.peakpx.com/613358/white-concrete-building-with-pillars">http://www.peakpx.com/613358/white-concrete-building-with-pillars</a><br /> all other images are from elsewhere on the wiki</p> 
